    (string=? f "title") (option-some-of [:option :string] "ANDI (Asociación Nacional de Empresarios de Colombia, historically Asociación Nacional de Industriales) was founded on 11 September 1944 in Medellín, by its own account. July's catalog could only reach Wikipedia, which was then internally inconsistent about the city (Usaquén vs Antioquia); the first-party page names Medellín and the statutes (Art. 2) fix Medellín as the domicile.")
